# development-only diversity I/Q captures (see test/diversity/devtools)
#
# captures/ is where diversity_capture_start() writes unless
# PIHPSDR_DIVCAP_DIR says otherwise. It is deliberately not in git - the
# set runs to tens of gigabytes - but the findings measured from it are,
# in docs/diversity-measurements.md, which names every capture it uses.
